          "id": 1310618079,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "The errors that this MR fixes.  \nThere are many/several/a few copies of `zlib1.dll` in my `wireshark-win64-libs` directory so without specifying the path, a random (and incorrect) copy is chosen?\n\n```\n       FinalizeBuildStatus:\n         Deleting file \"x64\\Release\\copy_qt_dlls\\copy_qt_dlls.tlog\\unsuccessfulbuild\".\n         Touching \"x64\\Release\\copy_qt_dlls\\copy_qt_dlls.tlog\\copy_qt_dlls.lastbuildstate\".\n   164>Done Building Project \"C:\\Development\\logray64\\copy_qt_dlls.vcxproj\" (default targets).\n    43>Done Building Project \"C:\\Development\\logray64\\copy_qt_dlls.vcxproj.metaproj\" (default targets).\n    28>Done Building Project \"C:\\Development\\logray64\\ALL_BUILD.vcxproj.metaproj\" (default targets) -- FAILED.\n     1>Done Building Project \"C:\\Development\\logray64\\Wireshark.sln\" (default targets) -- FAILED.\n\nBuild FAILED.\n\n       \"C:\\Development\\logray64\\Wireshark.sln\" (default target) (1) ->\n       \"C:\\Development\\logray64\\ALL_BUILD.vcxproj.metaproj\" (default target) (28) ->\n       \"C:\\Development\\logray64\\copy_ls_qt_dlls.vcxproj.metaproj\" (default target) (39) ->\n       \"C:\\Development\\logray64\\logray.vcxproj.metaproj\" (default target) (40) ->\n       \"C:\\Development\\logray64\\logray.vcxproj\" (default target) (159) ->\n       (Link target) ->\n         minizip.lib(zip.c.obj) : error LNK2019: unresolved external symbol __imp_deflate referenced in function zipCloseFileInZipRaw64 [C:\\Development\\logray\n       64\\logray.vcxproj]\n         minizip.lib(zip.c.obj) : error LNK2019: unresolved external symbol __imp_deflateEnd referenced in function zipCloseFileInZipRaw64 [C:\\Development\\log\n       ray64\\logray.vcxproj]\n         minizip.lib(zip.c.obj) : error LNK2019: unresolved external symbol __imp_crc32 referenced in function zipWriteInFileInZip [C:\\Development\\logray64\\lo\n       gray.vcxproj]\n         minizip.lib(unzip.c.obj) : error LNK2001: unresolved external symbol __imp_crc32 [C:\\Development\\logray64\\logray.vcxproj]\n         minizip.lib(zip.c.obj) : error LNK2019: unresolved external symbol __imp_deflateInit2_ referenced in function zipOpenNewFileInZip4_64 [C:\\Development\n       \\logray64\\logray.vcxproj]\n         minizip.lib(zip.c.obj) : error LNK2019: unresolved external symbol __imp_get_crc_table referenced in function zipOpenNewFileInZip4_64 [C:\\Development\n       \\logray64\\logray.vcxproj]\n         minizip.lib(unzip.c.obj) : error LNK2001: unresolved external symbol __imp_get_crc_table [C:\\Development\\logray64\\logray.vcxproj]\n         minizip.lib(unzip.c.obj) : error LNK2019: unresolved external symbol __imp_inflate referenced in function unzReadCurrentFile [C:\\Development\\logray64\n       \\logray.vcxproj]\n         minizip.lib(unzip.c.obj) : error LNK2019: unresolved external symbol __imp_inflateEnd referenced in function unzCloseCurrentFile [C:\\Development\\logr\n       ay64\\logray.vcxproj]\n         minizip.lib(unzip.c.obj) : error LNK2019: unresolved external symbol __imp_inflateInit2_ referenced in function unzOpenCurrentFile3 [C:\\Development\\l\n       ogray64\\logray.vcxproj]\n         C:\\Development\\logray64\\run\\Release\\Logray.exe : fatal error LNK1120: 8 unresolved externals [C:\\Development\\logray64\\logray.vcxproj]\n\n    0 Warning(s)\n    11 Error(s)\n\nTime Elapsed 00:01:27.39\n\nC:\\Development\\logray64>\n```",
