        },
        {
          "id": 1311901029,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "> Is it just an incorrect guess?  \nYES  \nLack of experience on my part. I find it confusing that `minizip` comes with  \n`W:\\Development\\wireshark-win64-libs\\minizip-1.2.11-4-win64ws\\installed\\x64-windows\\bin\\zlib1.dll`  \nbut the `zlib1.dll` in  \n\n`    \"W:/Development/wireshark-win64-libs/vcpkg-export-20220726-1-win64ws/installed/x64-windows/bin/zlib1.dll\"`  \nis used for linking.  \n  \nAll I wanted to do was delete 3 lines of codes in `logray` (!9912) and test before commit. :-)",
          "author": {
